HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request | Connection: close | bare LF in message head
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request | Connection: close | both Transfer-Encoding and Content-Length
HTTP/1.1 501 Not Implemented | Connection: close | unsupported transfer coding
HTTP/1.1 431 Request Header Fields Too Large | Connection: close | request head too large
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request | Connection: close | folded header line
HTTP/1.1 200 OK | echo GET /echo []HTTP/1.1 200 OK | Connection: close | echo GET /second []
HTTP/1.1 200 OK | Connection: close | echo GET /echo []
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request | Connection: close | malformed chunked request on HTTP/1.0
HTTP/1.1 200 OK | Connection: close | echo POST /echo []
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request | Connection: close | malformed request line
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request | Connection: close | malformed Host
HTTP/1.1 205 Reset Content | Connection: close
keep-alive 1: 200 echo GET /echo []
keep-alive 2: 200 echo GET /second []
stopped
after stop: connection closed before the response
sockets released: true
